# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/Surprise.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Surprise Passage
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 21st January by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Surveyed by: Pete Bolt, J. Hooper, Kev Senior, S. Jones and Dave Checkley
# Data entry: Ali

survey surprise

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	4.7	337	0	# ongoing
  2	3	0.5	240	0
  3	4	10.5	330	0
  4	5	6.0	341	0	# ongoing
  4	6	1.0	315	0
  6	7	1.8	273	0
  7	8	5.7	320	0	# connects to squirrel rifts
  7	9	5.8	282	0
  9	10	2.2	06	0	# equals squirrel Rifts station 3
  8	11	3.0	320	0	# closes down

endcentreline
endsurvey
